# Archived full-resolution source photos — kept in the repo as backups,
# never meant to be publicly served. Cloudflare Pages' _redirects only
# supports redirect codes (301/302/303/307/308), not a bare 404, so this
# redirects to a path with no matching route — which correctly resolves
# to a real 404 via 404.html, same as any other unmatched URL.
/img/original/*  /blocked-original-photo  301
